for PHP don't forget to set cgi.fix_pathinfo = 1 in the php.ini

You may want to run:

mkdir -p /etc/lighttpd && cp -f /usr/share/doc/lighttpd-1.4.13/lighttpd.conf /etc/lighttpd

A lighttpd virtual host may look like

$SERVER["socket"] == "66.45.243.126:80" {
        server.document-root = "/home/cute/public_html/126"
}


The fastcgi section may look like

fastcgi.server             = ( ".php" =>
                               ( "localhost" =>
                                 (
                                   "socket" => "/tmp/php-fastcgi.socket",
                                   "bin-path" => "/usr/local/bin/php"
                                 )
                               )
                            )



